OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will remain dry with clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Frost developing where skies
OL,9,Fbecome clear for some time. Minimum
OL,10,FTemperature 0C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA cloudy day with showery
OL,13,Frain spreading from the northwest,
OL,14,Freaching Shetland from late morning
OL,15,Fand Orkney in the evening. Maximum
OL,16,FTemperature 7C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
