OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fon Wednesday with showery rain.
OL,7,FBitterly cold northwesterly winds on
OL,8,FThursday and Friday with frequent snow
OL,9,Fshowers, perhaps some longer spells of
OL,10,Fsleet or snow across Shetland.
